        "original_id": "f44e4026-d545-5d56-ab29-9c8b1efac7bb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chas Chandler, John Constantine, Alan Moore, Steve Bissette, John Totleben, Jamie Delano, Philip Bond\n- Characters: John Constantine\n- Companies: DC Comics, Vertigo\n- Comics: Hellblazer Special: Bad Blood, Northlanders, Swamp Thing\n- Roles: sidekick, cab driver, writer, illustrator, creator\n\nFacts:\n- John Constantine was created by Alan Moore, Steve Bissette, and John Totleben and first appeared in Swamp Thing No. 25 in June 1984.\n- John Constantine is a fictional antihero who appears in comic books published by DC Comics and its alternative imprint Vertigo.\n- Chas Chandler is John Constantine's closest and longest surviving friend, and Chas Chandler acts as his sidekick and cab driver.\n- Hellblazer Special: Bad Blood was written by Jamie Delano, illustrated by Philip Bond, and features John Constantine several decades after most of his series continuity.\n- Northlanders is an American comic book series published by DC Comics under its Vertigo imprint.",
